{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43342","headline":"爲御史衔命出关谳狱道中看华山有诗 · 韩常侍","name":"爲御史衔命出关谳狱道中看华山有诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野麋蒙象暂如犀，心不惊鸥角骇鸡。\n一路好山无伴看，断肠烟景寄猨啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩常侍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}